{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChK4LCUKd1Z3U6YbHST6M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added the fix in `django/conf/__init__.py`, but I couldn't get a fully clean test run: 4 existing tests now fail because of the new behaviour, and 2 others errored for an unrelated reason.\n\n**The fix:** `settings.STATIC_URL` and `settings.MEDIA_URL` are now properties that add the request's `SCRIPT_NAME` prefix to relative values. So `STATIC_URL = 'static/'`, served under `/myapp`, becomes `/myapp/static/`. Values that start with `/` or are full URLs (like `http://cdn.example.com/`) stay as they are.\n\nBecause the change is in settings rather than in the template tags, the `{% static %}` tag, `FileSystemStorage` and `StaticFilesStorage` all pick up the prefix.\n\n**Test results** (run on `settings_tests`, `staticfiles_tests`, `file_storage`, the `static` template tag tests and `view_tests`):\n- **4 failures:** `test_setting_changed` in `file_storage.tests` (four storage test classes). Each one sets `MEDIA_URL` to `'overridden_media_url/'` and expects that value back unchanged; it now comes back as `'/overridden_media_url/'`. That's the new behaviour working, but these tests would need updating, and I left them alone because the rules say not to edit test files.\n- **2 errors:** two test classes failed to start with `PermissionError: Operation not permitted`. That looks like a sandbox restriction (likely the live-server tests not being allowed to open a socket). I didn't confirm it by running them elsewhere.\n- I also ran the same tests without my change and they finished without the 4 failures. I only kept the last few lines of that run, though, so I can't say whether the 2 errors showed up there too.\n\nI didn't add documentation or a release note for the change."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":754,"cache_read_input_tokens":22009,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":754},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c2cd19d-125d-4ed7-838d-a5be5f00d862","uuid":"defe6d97-216a-4bd9-8f98-e3de72af4bc6","timestamp":"2026-11-23T02:18:50.965Z","request_id":"req_011ChK4LCJR1sQWoAtHHLjNC"}
